{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T18:50:30.598Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/filter **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/firewall/filter \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/filter/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/filter/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/filter/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/filter/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/mangle **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/firewall/mangle \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/mangle/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/mangle/reset-counters \n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/mangle/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/mangle/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/nat **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/firewall/nat \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/nat/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/raw **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/firewall/raw \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters \n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters-all **Type:** Command":"## ipv6/firewall/raw/reset-counters-all \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/nd/prefix **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/nd/prefix \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/nd/prefix/default **Type:** Settings Directory":"## ipv6/nd/prefix/default \n**类型：** 设置目录","docs-7.25\u0000## ipv6/nd/proxy **Type:** Directory":"## ipv6/nd/proxy \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000An IPv6 Neighbor Discovery Proxy allows a router or host to respond to Neighbor Discovery([RFC 4861](LINK)) messages on behalf of another node. This enables communication across different network segments as if they were on the same link. In RouterOS, the proxy can be enabled for a single IPv6 address and works per interface.":"IPv6 邻居发现代理允许路由器或主机代表其他节点响应邻居发现（[RFC 4861](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4861)）消息。这使不同网段之间的通信如同位于同一链路上。在 RouterOS 中，可以为单个 IPv6 地址启用代理，并按接口工作。","docs-7.25\u0000An IPv6 firewall address list is a named set of IPv6 addresses and prefixes that IPv6 filter, NAT, mangle and raw rules match with `src-address-list` and `dst-address-list`. Entries are added here, by the `add-src-to-address-list` and `add-dst-to-address-list` rule actions, and from DNS names in the list. These actions pass the packet on to the next rule. IPv6 lists are separate from the IPv4 lists in [`/ip/firewall/address-list`](LINK), even when a list has the same name. See [Address lists](LINK).":"IPv6 防火墙地址列表是一组命名的 IPv6 地址和前缀，IPv6 filter、NAT、mangle 和 raw 规则通过 `src-address-list` 和 `dst-address-list` 与其匹配。条目在此处添加，也可通过 `add-src-to-address-list` 和 `add-dst-to-address-list` 规则动作添加，还可从列表中的 DNS 名称添加。这些动作会将数据包传递给下一条规则。IPv6 列表与 [`/ip/firewall/address-list`](/docs/7.25/cli-reference/ip/firewall/address-list) 中的 IPv4 列表相互独立，即使列表名称相同也是如此。请参阅 [Address lists](/docs/7.25/firewall-and-quality-of-service/firewall/address-lists)。","docs-7.25\u0000Prefix information sent in router advertisement(RA) messages used for stateless address autoconfiguration([RFC 4862](LINK)). By default, autoconfiguration applies only to hosts and not routers.":"在路由器通告（RA）消息中发送的前缀信息，用于无状态地址自动配置（[RFC 4862](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4862)）。默认情况下，自动配置仅应用于主机，不应用于路由器。","docs-7.25\u0000The DHCPv6 server delegates IPv6 prefixes(DHCPv6-PD) and assigns IPv6 addresses to clients. Prefixes and addresses come from IPv6 pools or from static bindings(`/ipv6/dhcp-server/binding`). For an overview and configuration examples, see [DHCPv6 Server](LINK).":"DHCPv6 服务器委派 IPv6 前缀（DHCPv6-PD），并向客户端分配 IPv6 地址。前缀和地址来自 IPv6 池或静态绑定（`/ipv6/dhcp-server/binding`）。有关概述和配置示例，请参阅 [DHCPv6 Server](/docs/network-management/dhcp/dhcpv6-server)。"}}
